# <%= current_page.data.title %>

## What it is

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| VM | `MPDIMZPSNP01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net` — RHEL 7.4 (2018 image), `Standard_DS2_v2`, no zone / availability set |
| IP / subnet | 10.200.65.44 · `SN-MPD-IMZ-PSNP-FTP-01` (10.200.65.40/29) · NSG `NS-MPD-IMZ-FTPS-INNER` · UDR `UR-IMZ-FTPS` |
| Software | HAProxy (role `psn_proxy`) — 3 services + stats page |

## What it's used for

From the prod HAProxy config and NSG flow analytics:

| Port | Service | Allowed source | Backend | Live traffic |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **7081** | CJSE / Police → CP (SPI case submissions). Forwards only `Host: apigw.cjscp.org.uk` | PSN 51.231.76.64/26 | APIM `sp-prd-apim-int` 10.202.65.100:443 (Host → `sp-prd-apim-int-gw.cp.cjs.hmcts.net`) | ✅ Active (from 51.231.76.85 / .118) |
| **7080** | CP → CJSE (results / SPI out) | APIM subnet 10.202.65.96/27 | `exchange-integration-services-stream.service.justice.gov.uk:7080` (exiss.q-solution.net, 51.231.76.88) | ✅ Active |
| **443** | CP → Courtstore (CMS). mTLS client cert `client.cms.court.store.justice.gov.uk.pem`, TLS 1.2, verify required | APIM subnet + function apps 10.202.68.160/28 | `cms.court.store.justice.gov.uk` 35.177.3.3 (CACI, AWS) | ✅ Busiest path (about 1M flows a week) |
| 8090 | HAProxy stats (basic auth) | — | — | — |

APIM's business APIs reach PSNP01 by **hard-coded IP** in named values (`hmcts/cpp-azure-api-management`, `prd/sp-prd-apim-int`):

| Named value | Value | Used by |
|---|---|---|
| `cjse-endpoint-base-url` | `http://10.200.65.44:7080` | `fa-prd-ccp0101-casefilter` → `spiout` |
| `route-to-cjse-base-url` | `http://10.200.65.44:7080` | `fa-prd-ccp0101-casefilter` → `cjsesubmitcaseapi` (relay) |
| `courtstore-endpoint-base-url` | `https://10.200.65.44/commonplatform/caseinformation` | `fa-prd-ccp0101-casefilter` → `courtstore` |

## Network flow

**A. CJSE inbound — Police / CJSE → CP (port 7081)**

```
┌─ PSN / CJSE (third party) ─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. CJSE Exchange (51.231.76.85 / .118)                                 │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  PSN
┌──────▼─ Cloud Gateway (third party) ───────────────────────────────────┐
│ 2. Firewall rule LIVE-GRP-PSN-POL-CJSE-SPI-IN — NAT to CP proxy VIP    │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  IPsec tunnel (LEG-CGI / LEG-CGI-DR)
┌──────▼─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 3. VG-MPD-OLDAZURE-01 (VPN gateway)                                    │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 4. MPDIMZPSNP01 :7081 (HAProxy)                                        │
│      │  only Host: apigw.cjscp.org.uk is forwarded                     │
│      │  HTTPS 443, Host → sp-prd-apim-int-gw.cp.cjs.hmcts.net          │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 5. APIM sp-prd-apim-int (10.202.65.100) → CP services                  │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**B. CJSE outbound — CP → Police / CJSE (port 7080)**

```
┌─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. APIM sp-prd-apim-int — casefilter APIs (spiout, cjsesubmitcaseapi)  │
│      │  HTTP 7080 → http://10.200.65.44:7080 (APIM named value)        │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 2. MPDIMZPSNP01 :7080 (HAProxy)                                        │
│      │  only accepts the APIM subnet 10.202.65.96/27                   │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 3. VG-MPD-OLDAZURE-01 (VPN gateway)                                    │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  IPsec tunnel (LEG-CGI / LEG-CGI-DR)
┌──────▼─ Cloud Gateway (third party) ───────────────────────────────────┐
│ 4. Firewall rule LIVE-HMCTS-CRIME-PROXY-PSN-OUT-44                     │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  PSN
┌──────▼─ PSN / CJSE (third party) ──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 5. CJSE Exchange                                                       │
│    exchange-integration-services-stream.service.justice.gov.uk:7080    │
│    (51.231.76.88)                                                      │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**C. Courtstore — CP → Courtstore (port 443, mutual TLS)**

```
┌─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. casefilter function apps → APIM sp-prd-apim-int (courtstore API)    │
