└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## How it's managed

| Item | Detail |
|---|---|
| VM IaC | `hmcts/cpp-automation-terraform` → `environments/live/mpd/integration_dmz/60-virtual_machines.tf` |
| Config | Ansible `sp-ansible/templates/haproxy-psn.cfg.j2`<br>Prod vars: `sp-ansible/group_vars/70_environment_mpd/psn.yml` (`crime-idam-automation-ansible` / `rota-automation-ansible`)<br>Role vars: `sp-ansible/group_vars/50_role_psn_proxy/*` |
| Recent config changes | APIM backend IP, Courtstore cert · DTSPO-230444 (Courtstore backend) · DTSPO-22246 (CJSE backend) |
| APIM config | `hmcts/cpp-azure-api-management` (extracted from APIM via ADO) |
| Secrets | Vault (certificates, keys) |
| Monitoring | Dynatrace OneAgent (installed on the VM and running) |
| Third parties | CJSE Exchange (Sopra Steria / Q-Solution) · Courtstore (CACI) · Cloud Gateway (PSN routing) — see [Third Party Contacts SRE](https://hmcts.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/HSS/pages/270186581/Third+Party+Contacts+SRE) |
| Backup | ❌ **None.** No Azure Backup in any vault, no disk backup, no snapshots or restore points. Single 32 GB Standard HDD (LRS) OS disk |

